# The forms only real mode has: rel16 branches, near and far call costs, and the
# segment loads. Every other form is the family's, `llrm-x86`'s x86.instr, read
# first; the columns are described there.
#
# name   operation shape            widths    cost        fixed                  iced
j{cc}    branch    -/-              -         jcc         -                      J{cc}_rel16
jmp      jump      -/-              -         jmp_short   -                      Jmp_rel16
call     call      -/-              -         call_far    -                      Call_rel16
les      move      r,r/m            16        les         d1=es                  Les_r16_m1616
lds      move      r,r/m            16        les         d1=ds                  Lds_r16_m1616
lfs      move      r,r/m            16        les         d1=fs                  Lfs_r16_m1616
lgs      move      r,r/m            16        les         d1=gs                  Lgs_r16_m1616
